/T (It must be said that self-therapy is not intended to be a complete replacement of traditional face-to-face therapy with a qualified and experienced professional. Instead, the goal of this ebook is to provide you with an opportunity to experiment with learning and applying the skills taught in evidence-based settings to your own unique situation, and to provide some relief to our overburdened mental health system. More importantly, it seeks to provide relief to you, who might be struggling to find any psychologists local to you with reasonable enough availability.)
