/T (Secure Attachment: Children with secure attachment bonds feel confident that their caregivers will be available and responsive to their needs. They feel safe exploring the world and seek comfort from their caregivers when distressed.)
/E (Secure Attachment: Children with secure attachment bonds feel confident that their caregivers will be available and responsive to their needs. They feel safe exploring the world and seek comfort from their caregivers when distressed.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [5]
>>
