/P 895 0 R
/T (Anxious-Preoccupied Attachment: Children with anxious-preoccupied attachment bonds may feel anxious or uncertain about their caregivers' availability and responsiveness. They may cling to their caregivers and worry about being abandoned or rejected.)
/E (Anxious-Preoccupied Attachment: Children with anxious-preoccupied attachment bonds may feel anxious or uncertain about their caregivers' availability and responsiveness. They may cling to their caregivers and worry about being abandoned or rejected.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
