/E (Avoidant Attachment: Children with avoidant attachment bonds may learn to self-soothe and minimize their emotional needs due to caregivers who are consistently unavailable or unresponsive. They may appear independent but struggle with intimacy and trust in relationships.)
/Pg 19 0 R
