/T (By engaging with cognitive strategies, you've learned to recognize and reframe the negative thoughts perpetuated by your inner critic. Techniques like cognitive restructuring have empowered you to identify distortions in your thinking, challenge unhelpful beliefs, and replace them with balanced and realistic perspectives. Every time you label a thought as a product of the inner critic rather than an absolute truth, you weaken its hold on your mind. Remember, every small step in reframing your thoughts is a victory in reclaiming your mental landscape from negativity.)
