/Title (As you continue to apply these strategies, you'll find that the space once occupied by the inner critic begins to fill with a healthier, more supportive inner voice. This voice encourages you, acknowledges your strengths, and affirms your worth. It reminds you that you are capable, resilient, and deserving of kindness and success. Nurturing this positive inner voice is key to sustaining the changes you've worked hard to achieve.)
/Dest [46 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2230 0 R
>>
endobj
