/Title (The inner critic can take on various personas and modes of expression. It may adopt the voice of a harsh parent, a judgmental authority figure, or even a critical peer. Regardless of its form, the inner critic's primary function is to enforce conformity to perceived standards of perfection, often at the expense of our well-being and self-esteem.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2384 0 R
